Subject: [PATCH] Follow explicit Store bundle membership and report catalog failures (#273)

Extend skeltavik's Durable back-reference fix (PR #298) to all product types.
Licensing entitlement keys name offers granting access, not contained packages.
Preserve direct packages, explicit bundle membership and fail-closed selection.
Add offline graph and loopback HTTP regressions without accessing an account.

